  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1309.06 Initial Review of Renewal Applications. Within 30 days of receipt of an application submitted pursuant to Plc 1309.03, the licensing bureau shall process the application as provided in Plc 308.09.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1300) #13701, eff 8-1-23",
